  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the person identifying as a firework",
  "description": "The text 'you identify as a firework' directly projects the user (the viewer) onto the conceptual entity of 'person' within the meme. The user is positioned as the subject of the self-identification, aligning with the visual of the crowd (silhouettes) watching fireworks, which serves as a metaphor for the user's own identity. The projection is onto the textual material that invokes self-identification, which then maps onto the visual material of the firework as a celebratory object.",
